  "prefLabel": "Emp 406.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Emp 406.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to clarify the requirements for compliance with section 3 of the Unemployment Compensation Extension Act of 2010, H.R. 4213 effective July 22, 2010.\n\nSource. #9761, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-26-10, EXPIRED: 1-24-11",
